TokenDuster is a concept for a Web3 component that let you clean up your wallet from dust tokens.

It is conceptualised for L2 networks and allows users for three main actions:

- Group your tokens and swap for stablecoin;
- Increase donations to verified NPO addresses;
- Send gifts to friends;

By purchasing the NFT you are supporting time invested in research, ideation and design towards a more friendly ecosystem for Web3.

NOTICE: The NFT represents a Figma prototype, no code has been developed (yet).

